Z||000011||Formula88||11-16-2001||09:09 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jncomutt:<BR><B>Where do these little smiley things comefrom?? EVeryone uses em but I dunno how to post em..</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Well, all you gotta do is post a link to the smiley just like any pic you'd post.  So, that means you have to have the smiley's online somewhere.  There are lots to find.  Try <A HREF="http://www.smilecwm.com" TARGET=_blank>http://www.smilecwm.com</A>  . That's where I get most of mine.<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.freakygamers.com/smilies/s/contrib/tweetz/bigeek.gif"> <p>[This message has been edited by Formula88 (edited 11-16-2001).]||||reg||1
